{
  "id": "JER.22",
  "number": "22",
  "bookId": "JER",
  "reference": "Jeremiah 22",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "22",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JER 22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "22",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.22.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.22.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; Go down to the house of the king of Judah, and speak there this word,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And say, Hear the word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.22.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.22.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", O king of Judah, that sittest upon the throne of David, thou, and thy servants, and thy people that enter in by these gates:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.22.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.22.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; Execute ye judgment and righteousness, and deliver the spoiled out of the hand of the oppressor: and do no wrong, do no violence to the stranger, the fatherless, nor the widow, neither shed innocent blood in this place.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For if ye do this thing indeed, then shall there enter in by the gates of this house kings sitting upon the throne of David, riding in chariots and on horses, he, and his servants, and his people.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But if ye will not hear these words, I swear by myself, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.22.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.22.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", that this house shall become a desolation.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For thus saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.22.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.22.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "unto the king's house of Judah; Thou",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "art",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.22.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.22.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gilead unto me,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.22.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.22.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the head of Lebanon:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "yet",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.22.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.22.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "surely I will make thee a wilderness,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.22.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.22.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cities",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "which",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.22.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.22.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "are not inhabited.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will prepare destroyers against thee, every one with his weapons: and they shall cut down thy choice cedars, and cast",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "them",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.22.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.22.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "into the fire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And many nations shall pass by this city, and they shall say every man to his neighbour, Wherefore hath the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.22.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.22.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "done thus unto this great city?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then they shall answer, Because they have forsaken the covenant of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.22.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.22.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "their God, and worshipped other gods, and served them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Weep ye not for the dead, neither bemoan him:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "but",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.22.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.22.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "weep sore for him that goeth away: for he shall return no more, nor see his native country.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For thus saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.22.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.22.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "touching Shallum the son of Josiah king of Judah, which reigned instead of Josiah his father, which went forth out of this place; He shall not return thither any more:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But he shall die in the place whither they have led him captive, and shall see this land no more.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Woe unto him that buildeth his house by unrighteousness, and his chambers by wrong;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.22.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.22.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "useth his neighbour's service without wages, and giveth him not for his work;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That saith, I will build me a wide house and large chambers, and cutteth him out windows; and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.22.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.22.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cieled with cedar, and painted with vermilion.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shalt thou reign, because thou closest",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "thyself",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.22.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.22.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in cedar? did not thy father eat and drink, and do judgment and justice,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.22.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.22.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "then",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.22.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.22.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "well with him?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He judged the cause of the poor and needy; then",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it was",
              "type": "text",
