            "sid": "JER 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore thus saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.22.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.22.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "concerning Jehoiakim the son of Josiah king of Judah; They shall not lament for him,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "saying",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.22.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.22.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", Ah my brother! or, Ah sister! they shall not lament for him,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "saying",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.22.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.22.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", Ah lord! or, Ah his glory!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He shall be buried with the burial of an ass, drawn and cast forth beyond the gates of Jerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Go up to Lebanon, and cry; and lift up thy voice in Bashan, and cry from the passages: for all thy lovers are destroyed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I spake unto thee in thy prosperity;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "but",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.22.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.22.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thou saidst, I will not hear. This",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "hath been",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.22.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.22.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thy manner from thy youth, that thou obeyedst not my voice.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The wind shall eat up all thy pastors, and thy lovers shall go into captivity: surely then shalt thou be ashamed and confounded for all thy wickedness.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O inhabitant of Lebanon, that makest thy nest in the cedars, how gracious shalt thou be when pangs come upon thee, the pain as of a woman in travail!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "As",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.22.24",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.22.24"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I live, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.22.24",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.22.24"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", though Coniah the son of Jehoiakim king of Judah were the signet upon my right hand, yet would I pluck thee thence;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will give thee into the hand of them that seek thy life, and into the hand",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "of them",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.22.25",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.22.25"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "whose face thou fearest, even into the hand of Nebuchadrezzar king of Babylon, and into the hand of the Chaldeans.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will cast thee out, and thy mother that bare thee, into another country, where ye were not born; and there shall ye die.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But to the land whereunto they desire to return, thither shall they not return.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
